ss=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/857770/extras/2766c79d80138c908be37e491e33511c.avif?t=1541130394\" width=64 height=64 /></span><br>Known as &quot;the Wendigo with the cackler grin&quot;, his greed for the weapons and the essence of the gangsters from twentieth century, is only to hide his own psychopathy</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Discover the endings of the eight characters.<br></li><li>Use 2 manual combos and 2 auto combos with only one button of each character.<br></li><li>One Hyper movement for each character, executable by only two buttons.<br></li><li>Kickback system: X-BREAKER. Executable by one button in critical health state.  <br></li><li>Face to 7 fighters in arcade mode and fight against the final boss.<br></li><li>Choose between four difficulty levels and experiment of a game mode that goes from the simplicity, to the frenzy.</li></ul>","developers":["Ignacio Medina","Santiago Medina"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/857770/header.jpg?t=1541130394","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92018 Dreamlands (Ignacio Medina, Santiago Medina)","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/857770/160965/12e4644fe7f9a540bc7ceaa006289fcad3102a2a/1751154161/dash_av1.mpd?t=1525834808","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/857770/160965/12e4644fe7f9a540bc7ceaa006289fcad3102a2a/1751154161/dash_h264.mpd?t=1525834808","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/857770/160965/12e4644fe7f9a540bc7ceaa006289fcad3102a2a/1751154161/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1525834808","id":256715773,"name":"The Risers Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256715773/movie.293x165.jpg?